Short:        Git 2.56 for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         dev/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/up-term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@ (it brings the patched ixemul.library)
Distribution: Aminet

Git 2.56.0 (the git program and its git-core helpers and templates) for an UP-Term window
(TERM=vtcon, the patched ixemul.library of the base archive). Built without Rust.

Needs the base archive up-term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes what this archive installed.

Licence: GPL 2.0 (Git); bundled libraries carry their own
(see LICENSES.txt in this archive).
